{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>《2026香港小姐競選》決賽將於月底隆重舉行，12位候選佳麗早前完成海外外景拍攝後，今日（13日）於決賽前夕再度以性感泳裝登場與傳媒會面。經過多個月來的密集式特訓與體形管理，多位佳麗身型線條明顯更為緊緻，狀態大勇，當中5號魏欣和6號盧蔚晴水蛇腰亦相當吸睛，冠軍之爭逐漸進入白熱化階段。</p><figure><img alt=\"12位候選佳麗於決賽前夕再度以性感泳裝登場與傳媒會面。（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260813/1164583000785031168546792.jpeg/md_jnWzxexsNhuyHN1_SHooXORoYd5UbijL69Yoy-vU\"/><figcaption>12位候選佳麗於決賽前夕再度以性感泳裝登場與傳媒會面。（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"1號袁絲珩。（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260813/1164583117176967168941538.jpeg/QQUBLqLHXJwbIEwdN7_ZY59xASGZOpi6h8BJ_YfASf0\"/><figcaption>1號袁絲珩。（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"2號李澤欣。（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260813/1164583291303497728195462.jpeg/pLW-HirBON3a9ZWdH_TegA46vT7V6FSCLYivNC2IrzQ\"/><figcaption>2號李澤欣。（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"3號李澄晴。（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260813/1164583642752618496917840.jpeg/fZzxxjQAh7cp77KkxA498mgAVDKi-OLM6YoFg-mKBYM\"/><figcaption>3號李澄晴。（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"4號譚雅文。（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260813/1164583853927436288756041.jpeg/fwq9qBzEJo8493EViPXpOx3SG02m0G7Lbjwvf248L38\"/><figcaption>4號譚雅文。（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"5號魏欣。（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260813/1164584400042594304683514.jpeg/tTV6P1Yho-jtF1jYg2z7veeW66VDrIVCQNbCP0DWwj8\"/><figcaption>5號魏欣。（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"6號盧蔚晴。（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260813/1164584691664162816390284.jpeg/rZ43OMP0Ay-hPJ6AZS_QISTuCuqCwDDA_99_Mv_ffzI\"/><figcaption>6號盧蔚晴。（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"7號楊媛媛。（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260813/1164584542313385984752836.jpeg/FaynuogoL4j0W788gVhlVWeNc7H3ZPuZ3jzSTd480k0\"/><figcaption>7號楊媛媛。（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"8號鄧匡閔。（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260813/1164584832076877824809514.jpeg/fckvbe6aIVtStRNE4VOfe_DWfcC49Yy_uFXJ5bhVyeU\"/><figcaption>8號鄧匡閔。（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"9號周芳姿。（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260813/1164585486979698688285369.jpeg/qUsdE_O1_2GDZu0a33tzElGM0rQnmrj4Bq8lgQavJYE\"/><figcaption>9號周芳姿。（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"10號陳梓穎。（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260813/1164584997575725056563104.jpeg/5FPE5bSGmLNHPw2t9UgfQzQLxHFy3t8jRyXGmEclxpg\"/><figcaption>10號陳梓穎。（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"11號顏懿菲。（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260813/1164585890098450432642789.jpeg/pd_J6XT9G17WmWB6K1TjfKdrwD2kyPmwBmKrdAZiq3Q\"/><figcaption>11號顏懿菲。（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"12號湯家琳。（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260813/1164586018398015488079528.jpeg/aERyLNyitPpTCYOmgs7WIF96CZdusTKhNHD5gTRw-YE\"/><figcaption>12號湯家琳。（截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-13T07:00:29.886386+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":308,"images":13,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}